      "text": "wife looked back … she became a pillar of salt, Gen. 19:26. Jacob … set it up for a pillar, and poured oil, Gen. 28:18. Jacob took a stone, and set it up for a pillar, Gen. 31:45. Jacob set up a pillar in the place where he talked, Gen. 35:14. by day in a pillar of a cloud … and by night in a pillar of fire, Ex. 13:21 (Num. 14:14; Neh. 9:12). pillar of the cloud went from before their face, Ex. 14:19. twelve pillars, according to the twelve tribes, Ex. 24:4. Samson … they set him between the pillars, Judg. 16:25. pillars of the earth are the Lord’s, 1 Sam. 2:8. he set up the pillars … of the temple, 1 Kgs. 7:21 (2 Chr. 3:17). shaketh the earth … the pillars thereof tremble, Job 9:6. pillars of heaven tremble, Job 26:11.",
